Subject: [PATCH] [VideoPlayer] Audio ID3: Show attached pictures as thumb

APIC frames in the ID3 stream were ignored, so streams such as DAB+
slideshows had no way to provide cover art. Store the picture in the
temp folder, named by its content hash, and set it as the playing
item's thumb.
